  "bodyHash": "274d8583f6f41438",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Edo5jnW.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available%20for%20Minecraft-1.19-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"248\" height=\"28\" />&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install%20on-Client%20%26%20Server-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiky-spikes/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7498\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiky-spikes/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7499\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Spiky Spikes</strong> 加入了許多非常尖銳的尖刺。共有多個階級，每個都具有獨特能力。還在等什麼？趕快去提升你的生物農場吧！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📚 內容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Spiky Spikes 為你帶來<strong>6 種階級</strong>的尖刺，每一種都獨樹一格。</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>木製：</strong> 會逐漸對生物造成伤害，但無法造成致命一擊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>石製：</strong> 會傷害並殺死生物，但不掉落任何戰利品或經驗值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>鐵製：</strong> 會傷害並殺死生物，僅掉落普通戰利品，不掉落經驗值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>金製：</strong> 會傷害並殺死生物，僅掉落經驗值，不掉落任何戰利品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>鑽石：</strong> 造成大量傷害，生物死亡時掉落所有戰利品，如同被玩家擊殺一般。可使用大多數劍附魔，需透過鐵砧進行附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>下界合金：</strong> 造成大量傷害，生物死亡時掉落所有戰利品，如同被玩家擊殺一般。可使用大多數劍附魔，需透過鐵砧進行附魔。具有爆炸抗性，且無法被凋靈首領摧毀。不會對玩家造成伤害。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>注意：</strong> 為鑽石和下界合金尖刺附魔時，請務必將所有要附魔的尖刺一次準備好。你可以將附魔書<strong>套用到整個堆疊</strong>，因此如果之後再想附魔更多尖刺，只會無謂地消耗你珍貴的附魔書。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📷 截圖：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/957/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/958/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>尖刺尖刺確實很尖</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>木製尖刺會讓生物掉到半顆心</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/959/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/960/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>即使是凋靈首領也無法抵擋下界合金尖刺</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>可套用在尖刺上的所有附魔</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>💡 常見問題：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：如何在 Forge 上設定此模組？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>安裝我的<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模組，即可直接在遊戲內進行設定！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：如何在 Fabric 上設定此模組？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>目前尚未實作遊戲內直接編輯設定的功能。請在進入世界後，執行<code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code>指令，選擇<code>CLIENT</code>或<code>SERVER</code>（依模組而定），接著點擊聊天視窗中出現的檔案名稱（結尾為 .toml），即可在外部編輯器中手動編輯設定檔。儲存檔案後，遊戲會在幾秒後自動重新載入設定，無需重新啟動遊戲。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>🏆 鳴謝：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Spiky Spikes 的開發得到了以下啟發與協助：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/rwtema\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>RWTema</strong></span></a>：啟發本模組，源自其<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-utilities\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Extra Utilities</span></a> 模組舊版本中的尖刺方塊</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/xfacthd\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>XFactHD</strong></span></a>：引導我學習在 Minecraft 中渲染非立方體形狀的進階技巧</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzss&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=u/Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs%200212&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-infuser-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ALHMDQn.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e4TeVgY.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tiny-skeletons-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GCYM7Zl.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q3CooZb.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vz0tBff.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
